    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυαρχ-ίς</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>admiral's
				flagship</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.51.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				2.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τριήρης</span>”
